      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُؤَثَّفٌ</span></b> (assumed tropical:)  <i>Short, broad, plump, and fleshy.</i> (K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And, with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>, (tropical:)  A woman <i>whose husband has
